			}
			case "Tell me of the Acolytes. "
			{
				bark("Well, there are four of us... Vardion, First Acolyte, Gorgrond, his faithful pet, Bane the Red, and myself. We are the ones that Master Malchir calls upon to aid in his great rituals. ");
